  {
   "text": "Ava's dog lunged at a squirrel, and the old leash clip opened.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.663
  },
  {
   "text": "He was gone down the trail.",
   "start": 3.763,
   "end": 5.086
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: check the clip, rings and buckle before every hike, and hold the short handle when people, bikes or horses pass.",
   "start": 5.236,
   "end": 12.685
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this.",
   "start": 12.985,
   "end": 13.689
